ented. For applications with custom title bars this can be especially useful, to act similarly to real system bars.\r\n\r\nTo use, simply execute `DisplayServer.window_show_system_menu()`. \r\n\r\nOn Windows, it uses `GetSystemMenu`. On Linux on Wayland, it uses libdecor's implementation, or `xdg_toplevel`'s. On X11 it sends a `_GTK_SHOW_WINDOW_MENU` event, although no GTK is used under the hood.\r\n\r\n(excuse the train wallpapers)\r\n\r\nLinux (Wayland)\r\n\r\n[Screencast_20250919_022019.webm](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d587a465-2c20-40be-857c-d635338184c9)\r\n\r\nLinux (X11 via XWayland)\r\n\r\n[Screencast_20250919_021843.webm](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f078ea44-0681-4d2e-884c-37834dc23857)\r\n\r\nWindows\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/64eeff6c-d3bb-4efc-9a40-87392ccc8573\r\n\r\n* *Bugsquad edit, closes: https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/13217*","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":205417413,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyMDU0MTc0MTM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:windows","name":"platform:windows","description":"","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097326,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTczMjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:linuxbsd","name":"platform:linuxbsd","description":"","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098255,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyNTU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:platforms","name":"topic:platforms","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.git